(text "COMMS. CAN1/CAN2 CA-IS3062W (VCC=+5V, 4.5-5.5V). Bus: CMC -> NUP2105L -> split termination via DIP (62R+62R, 4.7nF mid).\nRS-485 CA-IS2092W, SEL=GND_485 (3.3V VISO bus; DS: SEL=VISO only valid with VCC=5V), DIP for 120R term + 680R bias. Shields -> CHASSIS via 1M||4.7nF.\nUSB: CM5 USB2 -> USB-C service; USB3-0 -> USB-A (TPS2051C); USB3-1 HS -> USB2514B hub (DN1 M.2 modem, DN2 internal header, DN3/4 spare)." (exclude_from_sim no) (at 15 12 0) (effects (font (size 1.6 1.6)) (justify left top)) (uuid "56aed212-9822-4303-aa4e-78e3623e0575"))
)
